===persian===

در عبور شب
گرد گیسوی تو میگردم
مست از بوی تو می گردم
لب به گوش تو میکنم نجوا
این منم پنجاه
داغ تر از تب
سردتر از آه
خنده ات با اشک من همراه...
چند مهتاب دگر ؟
چند قرص ماه؟

تهران دی ماه ۱۳۵۱

===machine===

In the night,
I wander around your hair
I wander drunk on your scent
I whisper in your ear
This is me, fifty
Hotter than fever
Colder than a sigh
Your laughter is accompanied by my tears...
How many more moons?
How many moons?

Tehran, January 1972

===lantern===

In the passing of the night
I circle round your hair,
I wander drunk on your scent,
I set my lips to your ear and whisper:
here I am, fifty —
hotter than fever,
colder than a sigh,
your laughter keeping company with my tears...
How many more moonlit nights?
How many full moons left?

Tehran, Dey 1351

